        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana R2012, Wall Mounted Soap Holder With Glass</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen mounted to the wall, this soap dish will make a lovely and functional accessory to any bathroom. The timeless appeal of the R-Series Soap Holder can be found both in the traditional wall mount with concealed screws and in the beautiful finishes in which it is available. The bracket and rose are made of solid brass and the dish is made of frosted glass. Made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2012-specifications.gif?v=1704354730\" width=\"584\" height=\"272\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana R2012 Soap Holder with Glass Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana R Series\"><b>Deltana R-Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the R-Series Classic Soap Dish:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass wall mount with a glass dish.</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2012.pdf?v=1704262290\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana R2012 Soap Holder with Glass Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 soap dish, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
