                "description": "When mounted to the wall, this soap dish will make a lovely and functional accessory to any bathroom. The timeless appeal of the R-Series Soap Holder can be found both in the traditional wall mount with concealed screws and in the beautiful finishes in which it is available. The bracket and rose are made of solid brass and the dish is made of frosted glass. Made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for.\r\n",
